<title>HONG KONG: Van Shung Chong posts higher interim net.</title>
<headline>Van Shung Chong posts higher interim net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.0     vs 13.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.6	vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    38.55    vs 32.88</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,009.65 vs 803.48</p>
<p>    Company name		 Van Shung Chong Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 16, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 22, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Van Shung Chong Holdings is a trader of reinforced steel.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
